        <link href="https://github.com/Roald87/FeedReader/pull/3"/>
        <updated>2026-03-09T19:53:54.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20192767?u=834cb836c31dc8785f67cba7791a479e4dcd82a9&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Summary</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Fix <code class="notranslate">ParseFeedUrlsFromHtml</code> regex to match <code class="notranslate">rel=alternate</code> without quotes (valid HTML5)</li>
<li>Fix <code class="notranslate">GetAttributeFromLinkTag</code> to handle both quoted and unquoted attribute values</li>
<li>Upgrade target frameworks from net8.0 to net10.0</li>
<li>Add tests covering unquoted attributes and a real-world HTML fixture from shkspr.mobi</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Test plan</h2>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> <code class="notranslate">TestUnquotedAttributes</code> — parses a link tag with all unquoted attributes correctly</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> <code class="notranslate">ParseFeedsShksprMobi</code> — parses the shkspr.mobi HTML fixture and finds both Atom and RSS feeds</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> All existing tests still pass (2 timezone-sensitive <code class="notranslate">TestDateTimeParse</code> cases were already failing before this change)</li>
</ul>
